<page-nav-bar back="{{true}}"></page-nav-bar>

<scroll-view class="scrollarea" scroll-y>
  <view class="container page-ambient">
    <view class="guide-hero">
      <text class="guide-hero-title">快速连接</text>
      <text class="guide-hero-desc">按以下步骤操作，即可开始控制灯光</text>
    </view>

    <view class="step-card card">
      <view class="step-row">
        <view class="step-num-wrap"><text class="step-num">01</text></view>
        <view class="step-body">
          <text class="step-title">安装电池</text>
          <text class="step-desc">确保荧光棒已安装电池或已充好电</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="step-divider"></view>

      <view class="step-row">
        <view class="step-num-wrap"><text class="step-num">02</text></view>
        <view class="step-body">
          <text class="step-title">开启电源</text>
          <text class="step-desc">长按设备电源键，直到指示灯亮起</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="step-divider"></view>

      <view class="step-row">
        <view class="step-num-wrap"><text class="step-num">03</text></view>
        <view class="step-body step-body--with-connect">
          <text class="step-title">连接测试</text>
          <text class="step-desc">按下连接按钮，设备会响应显示一段专属灯光</text>
          <view class="connect-btn" hover-class="connect-btn-hover" bindtap="goConnect">立即连接</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="notes-card card">
      <text class="notes-title">注意事项</text>
      <text class="notes-text">同一场地中，只需开启一部手机即可使用小程序控制多个荧光棒。如有多台手机打开应用，可能出现灯光信号控制干扰。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</scroll-view>
